n.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-qi[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-qi/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reparent the subscriptions album and untype bank.md in the [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]vault[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-hub[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-hub: move subscriptions.md under cash and sync albums while [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank.md is still an area. Then remove bank.md's area type, fix its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]summary and prose, sync areas, and prove the albums, areas, bank, props,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and capture-target outputs are clean through their structured output.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove the bank area contract from bob and guard the no-tasks [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]hub[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-hub[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-hub: drop NoteKind::Bank from the props settings contract (a ! [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit), refuse @bank task captures with a preview diagnostic, and add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the bank_hub_task and bank_hub_area_type findings to bob bank check. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Also fix the starter text and the note-catalog order, invert the hybrid [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, untype the hub fixtures, and correct the bob-cli docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Delete the bank/area arbitration and restore the single-owner [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]Bank Card[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-single-owner[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-single-owner: delete 249db and every bank/area arbitration hook [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in bob-ledger-tools, restore the bank.md home-card exclusion, and gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank on props_v1. Bank becomes a no-settings Property Editor kind [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]whatever bob reports. Settle the 240r foot lifecycle by a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]species-agnostic test, convert the hybrid unit and e2e cases, fix the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline harness blockers, then build, test, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian takeover acceptance and family screenshot review[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]takeover-proof[dim] · [dim][/dim]after vault-hub, cli-hub, plugin-single-owner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]takeover-proof: run the production-adapter matrix in isolated real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Obsidian against a master-built bob, covering area, inbox, project, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the single-owner bank card. Prove fail-open, focus, routing, and ^prj [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integrity, and repair defects this work caused. Review light/dark and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]narrow/wide screenshots across the card family and retain all evidence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Re-run the retired project-count cleanup in the vault[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]count-sweep[dim] · [dim][/dim]after vault-hub, cli-hub, plugin-single-owner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]count-sweep: dry-run the landed retire-project-count-keys tool against [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the live vault with a current bob. If any host recreated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task_count/open_task_count, attribute that host and apply the guarded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cleanup, then prove a repeat dry-run is a no-op and retain the receipts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #A